Concept: Alvarado. Development and implementation: Alvarado and Rohit Gupta.

Electronics: metal mesh, multi-LED pack, sensor, custom circuitry, bespoke software. 25 × 10 × 50 cm.

Politics, power, and money have clouded the minds of today's leaders — no different in their conduct from the ancient rulers we once called barbarians. What prevails is folly. They squawk in their cage.

They make us doubt human evolution. While they squawk, the planet weighs whether it wants humans to keep existing.
